22px&quot;&gt;Tool parameter&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;name, unit, nominal&lt;br&gt;UCL, LCL, alert thresholds&lt;br&gt;tool (FK), chamber" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#047857;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="586" y="460" width="400" height="148" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rule" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#065F46&quot; style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;Business rule&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;when (condition), then (action)&lt;br&gt;priority, plain-language reason&lt;br&gt;applies to site, tool or class" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#047857;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="586" y="690" width="400" height="148" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmap" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#065F46&quot; style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;Process map&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;current or future state&lt;br&gt;ordered steps and transitions&lt;br&gt;rule (FK) per transition" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#047857;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="586" y="920" width="400" height="148" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cmd" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#065F46&quot; style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;Command catalog&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;name, system or application&lt;br&gt;payload schema, events emitted" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#047857;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="76" y="1050" width="400" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="evt" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7A5C00&quot; style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;Event (bus envelope)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;eventId, type, sequence, time&lt;br&gt;correlationId, causationId,&lt;br&gt;parentEventId, source, site, tool" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A16207;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1096" y="230" width="400" height="148" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tel" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7A5C00&quot; style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;Telemetry reading&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;tool parameter (FK), time, value&lt;br&gt;eventId (FK)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A16207;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1096" y="490" width="400" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="alert" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7A5C00&quot; style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;Alert&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;SPC rule, severity, value vs limit&lt;br&gt;triggering event (FK)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A16207;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1096" y="690" width="400" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ticket" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7A5C00&quot; style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;Ticket&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;source: SPC, operator, upload,&lt;br&gt;QMS, supplier; status, priority&lt;br&gt;rule fired (FK)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A16207;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1606" y="230" width="400" height="148" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="inv" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7A5C00&quot; style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;Investigation&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;status, confidence, cause&lt;br&gt;ticket (FK), escalated (yes or no)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A16207;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1606" y="490" width="400" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="evid" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7A5C00&quot; style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;Evidence item&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;finding, value vs spec, time&lt;br&gt;source events (FK to Event)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A16207;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1606" y="720" width="400" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="appr" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7A5C00&quot; style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;Approval&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;decision, approver, reason&lt;br&gt;investigation (FK)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A16207;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2116" y="230" width="400" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="capa" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7A5C00&quot; style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;CAPA&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;action, owner, due, status&lt;br&gt;approval (FK)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A16207;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2116" y="460" width="400" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="scen" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7A5C00&quot; style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;Scenario&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;plain-language card, sensors moved&lt;br&gt;recorded messages for replay" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A16207;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2116" y="690" width="400" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="doc" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7A5C00&quot; style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;Uploaded document&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;instrument printout, readings found&lt;br&gt;confirmed by (person)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A16207;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1096" y="930" width="400" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e0" value="1 to many" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="company" target="site"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="1 to many" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="site" target="cap"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="1 to many" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cap" target="line"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="1 to many" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="line" target="tool"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="1 to many" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="tool" target="param"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="param" target="rule"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="rule" target="pmap"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" value="1 to 1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="evt" target="tel"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="causes" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="tel" target="alert"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e9" value="opens" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="alert" target="ticket"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e10" value="1 to many" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ticket" target="inv"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e11" value="1 to many" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="inv" target="evid"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e12" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ticket" target="appr"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e13" value="1 to 1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="appr" target="capa"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e14" value="emits" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cmd" target="evt"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="notes" value="NOTES
* Demo store is intentionally thin: metadata lives in YAML files with exactly this structure; transactions and telemetry live in SQLite.
* Target store: relational (Azure SQL) for metadata and transactions, time series for telemetry, optional graph store for event lineage.
* Every transaction row keeps the eventId that created it, so any item can be traced back through causationId and parentEventId to its root.
* Hard reset keeps every metadata entity and purges every transaction entity, then seeds nominal telemetry. Soft reset keeps all rows.
FK = reference to another entity. Capability types are all modeled; only Manufacturing is simulated in the demo." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=19;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=#0B1B33;fillColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="1486" width="1580" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tb" value="Meridian Precision Systems · FabOps
